{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_028_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2f7bc1f7099a41522f4850f9dea46ffdce513fbab5498c9bf46c8b6931a57168",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b6876e7fb12620538f292ee54d19343ed84a220f3f11911e406e113484c1311",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26241384b495ff46de1f6b44e439e31276e79a74af225c9f8788c2a30b1db360",
      "text": "我是来把情人节巧克力的\n回礼送给您的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b9da261a21c98034855808c56c79727e6ef66b5a458aca3e9f3f4ae1205f250",
      "text": "请您收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ec02a5666c3d87322e4d3b8d6f0366e4f37e2809e2d8bee4bfd621a88ac67b6",
      "text": "虽然不知是否能合您的心意，\n但我以自己的方式倾注了感谢之情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3052e952ccc8dc2604a32c4f64427a50896504bcf87e22b3e483e749c1a3b117",
      "text": "这份心意若是能传达给您，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a9d1d92ea1a36dfb8e127d8d145400e2e3f02972235d3c3516589fa5eda3918",
      "text": "让您久等了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n承蒙您特意跑一趟，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32e58fbfeec46d9898b0e62693d87ce1619484886898b282c590290b4baadc06",
      "text": "其实，我是想着要为您送上情人节的回礼。\n首先请收下这一份。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67c891d0ab8a631bd50636e909407196ee1ba65d8dd07acb8d9180bf12606250",
      "text": "另外，作为您特意前来的谢礼，我还准备了甜点。\n请进，到店里来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000044:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a3d6bbc72a444f24a73d594d5daccd995030f7cce44b7c0e77b5d5cb3e97d6",
      "text": "就是这道了。\n请，请慢用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000057:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afe0ee84c7c6fb77343d1f8c368634e4f4900fbbd88e0cc13bf43e59742fc0f3",
      "text": "真的可以吃这么多吗？非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000058:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fdbe36964718b8907b47e26a155d51a949c46660f6bfe6d8d5b82e981a6a3c4",
      "text": "真是感慨万千……！非常感谢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35cd208ad75bfcc0f176adfb6a09a77158aba31d4bffd3e7930e391e27907c80",
      "text": "看到您似乎很高兴，比什么都好。\n我也算没有白准备一番了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e19b8c2ee936bc440862289197cb060639f7379d0a076addd89e8f579b2d86f5",
      "text": "居然能让您高兴成这样……\n呵呵，我也很高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8abb750b18653916db9d757e7714987a1435034aff2b0f7f47c29d8f6b26e0f0",
      "text": "那时真的非常感谢您。\n收到的巧克力，味道非常美妙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:664a6b096c54bbd66621b77e5c82499ae170ed128316315977f3d5521abf2c94",
      "text": "为了能回应那盒巧克力以及准备了它的您的期待，\n今后我也会继续全力迈进的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_028_22:5_02_028_22_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c38eb214a0a46f5dcd3c8488edd895c4be0b532e626e4148e350d08bb6a1ad25",
      "text": "好啦，工作的话题就先聊到这里……\n现在请慢慢享用甜点吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
